      text: Exit
    - id: 35
      language: en
      text: Noice
    - id: 36
      language: en
      text: Do you need something else?
    - id: 37
      language: en
      text: 'Hello adventurer! '
    - id: 38
      language: en
      text: Teach me
    - id: 39
      language: en
      text: Alakfein the Cleric
    - id: 40
      language: en
      text: Erevan the Cleric
    - id: 41
      language: en
      text: Erevan, Priest of the Temple of Gods
    - id: 42
      language: en
      text: Welcome to the Gods temple.
    - id: 43
      language: en
      text: 'Udros destroyed '
    - id: 44
      language: en
      text: Bring 100 udros crystals and save us all. Find them and sacrifice them
        to Udros.
    - id: 45
      language: en
      text: To do that, go to his altar, and interact.
    - id: 46
      language: en
      text: To do this, go to his altar, and interact.
    - id: 47
      language: en
      text: When you will have 100, you will have an opportunity to enter his domain
        and defeat him.
    - id: 48
      language: en
      text: Good luck!
    - id: 49
      language: en
      text: Bring 100 udros crystals and save us all.
    - id: 50
      language: en
      text: To do this, go to crystal bowl and interact.
    - id: 51
      language: en
      text: Find crystals, put them into bowl, and fight with Udros in his domain.
